{%- style -%}
  #cora-terms-{{ section.id }} {
    background-color: {{ section.settings.bg_color }};
       padding:  20px;
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    color: #333;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .cora-policy-container {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: #fff;
    padding: 0;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-align: justify; /* Default alignment for container */
  }

  /* TYPOGRAPHY */
  .cora-policy-title {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #000;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    text-align: justify; /* Changed from center to justify */
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .cora-policy-intro {
    text-align: justify; /* Changed from center to justify */
    color: #666;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .cora-policy-heading {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: rgb(18, 18, 18); /* Imperial Blue */
    margin-top: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
    padding-bottom: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-align: justify; /* Explicitly set to justify */
  }

  .cora-policy-text {
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    text-align: justify;
  }

  .cora-policy-list {
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    padding-left: 20px;
    text-align: justify;
  }
  .cora-policy-list li {
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .cora-highlight {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #000;
  }

  .cora-link {
    color: #2f5496;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  /* RESPONSIVE */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .cora-policy-container {
      padding: 30px 20px;
    }
    .cora-policy-title {
      font-size: 24px;
    }
  }
{%- endstyle -%}

<section id="cora-terms-{{ section.id }}">
  <div class="cora-policy-container">
    
    <h1 class="cora-policy-title">Terms & Conditions</h1>
    <p class="cora-policy-intro">
      <strong>Last Updated:</strong> January 11, 2025<br>
      Welcome to Imperial Knots. This website is operated by <strong>Imperial Mastercrafts</strong> (“we”, “us”, or “our”). By accessing or making a purchase from this website, you agree to be bound by these Terms & Conditions.
    </p>

    <h2 class="cora-policy-heading">1. General Use</h2>
    <p class="cora-policy-text">By using this website, you confirm that you are at least <span class="cora-highlight">18 years old</span>, or using it under the supervision of a parent or legal guardian. We reserve the right to refuse or discontinue service at our discretion.</p>

    <h2 class="cora-policy-heading">2. Product Display & Information</h2>
    <p class="cora-policy-text">We make every effort to display product colors and textures accurately. However, <span class="cora-highlight">color variations may occur</span> due to individual monitor settings and photography lighting. Product availability and pricing may change without notice.</p>

    <h2 class="cora-policy-heading">3. Pricing & Order Acceptance</h2>
    <p class="cora-policy-text">All orders placed constitute an <span class="cora-highlight">offer</span> to purchase. We may accept or decline any order at our discretion. If an order is canceled after payment, a <span class="cora-highlight">full refund</span> will be issued.</p>

    <h2 class="cora-policy-heading">4. Order Cancellation Policy</h2>
    <ul class="cora-policy-list">
      <li>Cancellation <span class="cora-highlight">within 24 hours</span> of placing an order may be accepted.</li>
      <li>Cancellations after 24 hours incur a <span class="cora-highlight">10% restocking fee</span>.</li>
      <li>Orders <span class="cora-highlight">cannot be canceled</span> once processed or shipped.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="cora-policy-heading">5. Shipping & Delivery</h2>
    <p class="cora-policy-text">We ship through trusted courier services. The Customer is responsible for providing accurate shipping details. If delivery fails due to incorrect/incomplete information or receiver unavailability, <span class="cora-highlight">re-delivery charges apply</span>. Delivery concerns must be reported <span class="cora-highlight">within 15 days of receipt</span>.</p>

    <h2 class="cora-policy-heading">6. Returns & Exchanges</h2>
    <p class="cora-policy-text">Returns are accepted strictly in accordance with our <span class="cora-highlight">Return Policy</span>.</p>

    <h2 class="cora-policy-heading">7. Copyright & Website Content</h2>
    <p class="cora-policy-text">This website, including its design, text, graphics, product images, and content, is the <span class="cora-highlight">exclusive intellectual property of Imperial Mastercrafts</span> and is protected under applicable copyright laws.</p>
    <ul class="cora-policy-list">
      <li>Copying, reproducing, altering, or imitating any part of the website is strictly prohibited.</li>
      <li>This includes content displayed on our social media platforms.</li>
      <li>Any unauthorized reproduction, plagiarism, or misuse <span class="cora-highlight">may result in legal action</span> under laws governed by the <span class="cora-highlight">Supreme Court of India</span>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="cora-policy-heading">8. Trademarks</h2>
    <p class="cora-policy-text">All trademarks, logos, brand names, and product names displayed on this website are the <span class="cora-highlight">property of Imperial Mastercrafts</span>. You may not use any mark without <span class="cora-highlight">prior written consent</span>.</p>

    <h2 class="cora-policy-heading">9. Third-Party Links</h2>
    <p class="cora-policy-text">Our website may contain links to third-party websites. These are provided for convenience only — <span class="cora-highlight">we do not control or endorse these websites</span> and are not responsible for any content or consequences arising from their use.</p>

    <h2 class="cora-policy-heading">10. Prohibited User Conduct</h2>
    <p class="cora-policy-text">You agree <span class="cora-highlight">NOT</span> to upload, share, transmit, or publish any content that:</p>
    <ul class="cora-policy-list">
      <li>Belongs to another person without authorization</li>
      <li>Is defamatory, obscene, pornographic, harmful, hateful, abusive, or unlawful</li>
      <li>Encourages harm to minors</li>
      <li>Infringes any copyright, trademark, or proprietary rights</li>
      <li>Violates any Indian law</li>
      <li>Contains malware, viruses, or disruptive code</li>
      <li>Impersonates another individual</li>
      <li>Threatens national security, sovereignty, or public order</li>
      <li>Disrupts or overloads the website infrastructure</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="cora-policy-text">Any violation may lead to <span class="cora-highlight">account suspension, legal liability, and/or reporting to authorities.</span></p>

    <h2 class="cora-policy-heading">11. Credit / Debit Card & Payment Information</h2>
    <p class="cora-policy-text">You confirm that the payment information you provide is <span class="cora-highlight">accurate and lawfully owned by you</span>. We <span class="cora-highlight">do not store card details</span> and do not share such data except where required for verification, fraud prevention, or under legal directives.</p>
    <p class="cora-policy-text">We are <span class="cora-highlight">not responsible</span> for credit card fraud. The responsibility to prove unauthorized usage lies with the user.</p>

    <h2 class="cora-policy-heading">12. Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p class="cora-policy-text">Imperial Mastercrafts is not liable for:</p>
    <ul class="cora-policy-list">
      <li>Delivery delays or courier issues beyond our control</li>
      <li>Unauthorized access to customer data</li>
      <li>Any loss arising from fraudulent card activity</li>
      <li>Service interruptions, data errors, or website downtime</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="cora-policy-text">All products and website services are provided <span class="cora-highlight">“as is”</span>.</p>

    <h2 class="cora-policy-heading">13. Indemnification</h2>
    <p class="cora-policy-text">You agree to indemnify and hold Imperial Mastercrafts harmless from any claims arising out of your misuse of the website, breach of these terms, or violation of laws or third-party rights.</p>

    <h2 class="cora-policy-heading">14. Governing Law</h2>
    <p class="cora-policy-text">These Terms are governed by the laws of <span class="cora-highlight">India</span>, and all disputes are subject exclusively to the jurisdiction of <span class="cora-highlight">courts in Delhi</span>.</p>

    <h2 class="cora-policy-heading">15. Contact Information</h2>
    <p class="cora-policy-text">For queries, please contact:</p>
    <p class="cora-policy-text">
      <strong>Imperial Knots</strong><br>
      Email: <a href="mailto:info@imperialknots.com" class="cora-link">info@imperialknots.com</a>
    </p>

  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Terms & Conditions Doc",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "bg_color",
      "label": "Background Color",
      "default": "#f4f4f4"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Terms & Conditions Doc"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}